# Runtime directories for the OpenBlock dedicated server.
#
# Install as /usr/lib/tmpfiles.d/openblock-server.conf and apply with:
#   systemd-tmpfiles --create /usr/lib/tmpfiles.d/openblock-server.conf
#
# /var/lib/openblock is created and owned by systemd through StateDirectory=,
# so it is intentionally not repeated here. Backups are written by the
# operator-run scripts/server-backup.sh; the directory is root-owned and 0700
# because world snapshots can contain player names and chat-adjacent state.
d /var/backups/openblock 0700 root root -
